eADpSyjE2Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>-SCAU-</span></p></section><section><p><span>来源丨党委宣传部</span></p><p><span>编辑</span><span>丨新禾融媒体工作室 王泽墁</span></p><p><span>初审丨费思迎</span></p><p><span>复审丨陈芃辰</span></p><p><span>终审丨胡东生</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>“</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAwDTISmAy5HibibXnDkcLWM6Y30yo4hW0icFgjtM3ib4oqViaBs9uFDicXibI6KloiceUlZdjGPCpadV33Tu8oszVrkRXMg14LW8QWKvA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>”</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>扫码关注华农官微，获取最新资讯</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckC0SvjHhOu6oZia3SxTQQrc5S94YRj8w4ZBmYE5iaB7EMp1CLeVAjp7WtCVStvVULK0kSqcI9WicIUPyRfgQic3S36LmibMDSQZdJbE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>点赞</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckDzKCnEJ6KGOQGN7wq9fFKyadDHl6IoGl4zRgpgQF0aupAeTRp8MVdhcKfMa36ECqgx2WwicCiauwmy9bE5DMMiadalU0Vl9SnPro/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>分享</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckCBkQapK1w1bsLGWsFJbedIjYcRNPlQVibKker5bJ8dt5MpFy4wdQxoR1UdfLYRydglDF1EgIUMTehECfkMWSs8rK8fdqzhUtSE/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>推荐</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckD6ARcwEHmOBP3wtOD9Ou142v5gdaoXQib9yp8vTFcibg66ib0gMc40gaEVDp0xlmnR67ibWLszxqX4K1rEdGdaI7kDQZAB0gflPSg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></div>"}
